.claude/
test-results/
web/test-results/
playwright-report/
web/playwright-report/

# Web UI build output. Produced by `make build-embed` (vite → internal/web/dist),
# embedded into the binary via the `embed_web` build tag. Kept out of git so
# each hash-named bundle doesn't accumulate ~380 KB of pack history per change.
internal/web/dist/
